of_scope_change_fails taskplane/tests/test_binding_obligations.py::TheRunDeclaresWhatItOwesUpFront::test_a_review_owes_the_dashboard_with_its_embedded_graph taskplane/tests/test_loop.py::TestLoop::test_evaluator_unavailable_remains_non_judged_and_keeps_readiness_closed taskplane/tests/test_loop.py::TestLoop::test_unavailable_warning_preserves_exact_outage_identity_without_pass_verdict taskplane/tests/test_loop.py::TestLoop::test_evaluator_unavailable_retry_returns_to_evaluate_without_opening_fix taskplane/tests/test_loop.py::TestParallelExecution::test_parallel_execute_gate_validates_claimed_task_worktree taskplane/tests/test_loop.py::TestParallelExecution::test_evaluator_evidence_binds_claimed_worktree_from_either_checkout",
